posts.body:
@TESTOSTERONE
Thanks! The probability information is very helpful and something I didn’t even think to try to determine. That is a great way of looking at it.
@ShadowDragon
Thanks! Since I’m using dice instead of cards, there can’t be any flush or royal flush. Just like in cards there isn’t any 5 of a kind.
As an aside, I was also wondering if I should include the possibility of both a small straight and a pair at the same time.
If so, where might that “score” fall?
